          NUMBER, COMMENT, STRING, KEYWORD, FUNCTION, HEADER, LABEL, MATCH,
          COLUMN, POSTCOMPARE, MARKUP, DIRECTORY.
          'section' can also be specified as '*', in which case all headers
          are applied or not applied.
     
